WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
My fellow citizens, the election draws near!

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Consider carefully where your vote shall fall.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.000
For the prosperity of our great nation depends upon it!

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.000
I pledge to serve with honor and distinction.